# Material library for test_sphere.obj.
#
# Uses the PBR extensions to the Wavefront format that Blender, Substance and Maya all
# write: Pm for metallic, Pr for roughness. Hypergraphical reads these and derives a
# material automatically, so this model renders correctly with no material JSON at all.
# Pack JSON with the id hypergraphical:auto/... would override it.

newmtl chrome
Kd 0.900000 0.910000 0.920000
Ks 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Pm 1.000000
Pr 0.050000
d 1.000000
illum 2
